    "_doc": [
      "UAP covenant v2 output-script format vectors. Shared fixture: read by",
      "src/test/uap_mint_tests.cpp (C++), contrib/uap-indexer (Go) and",
      "contrib/uap-js (JavaScript), so all three agree byte for byte on which",
      "scripts are UAP outputs.",
      "",
      "  mint:      <pubkey> <multiplier> OP_MINT",
      "  transfer:  <pubkey> <multiplier> <origin32> OP_MINT_TRANSFER",
      "",
      "SCOPE: single scripts, parsed in isolation. Anything that depends on the",
      "spending transaction as a whole -- conservation, merging two positions of",
      "one lineage, rejecting a cross-lineage merge, deriving a mint's origin",
      "from its outpoint -- CANNOT be expressed here, because a vector is one",
      "script with no transaction around it. Those rules are tested in",
      "src/test/uap_mint_tests.cpp; see the 'lineage identity and merging'",
      "section there. Read both or you have only half the format."
    ]
